{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000403","compactId":"SO_0000403","id":"SO:0000403","label":"U14_snoRNA","definition":{"text":"U14 small nucleolar RNA (U14 snoRNA) is required for early cleavages of eukaryotic precursor rRNAs. In yeasts, this molecule possess a stem-loop region (known as the Y-domain) which is essential for function. A similar structure, but with a different consensus sequence, is found in plants, but is absent in vertebrates.","xrefs":["PMID:2551119","http://www.sanger.ac.uk/cgi-bin/Rfam/getacc?RF00016"]},"comments":["An evolutionarily conserved eukaryotic low molecular weight RNA capable of intermolecular hybridization with both homologous and heterologous 18S rRNA."],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"U14 small nucleolar RNA"},{"scope":"exact","value":"U14 snoRNA"},{"scope":"exact","value":"small nucleolar RNA U14"},{"scope":"exact","value":"snoRNA U14"}],"xrefs":[],"subsets":["SOFA"],"altIds":["SO:0005839"],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000403/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"}]},"parents":["SO:0000593"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0000593","SO:0000275","SO:0002247","SO:0000655","SO:0000233","SO:0000673","SO:0000831","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[{"predicate":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/so#derives_from","target":"SO:0005837"}],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000593"],"children":[],"related":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0005837"]}},"graph":{"parents":[{"iri":"http://pur